In our “fixed” version the cases for "CI" and "CD" have been swapped. Now the ICCID value read from the stream is stored (in "CI") while the format string from the "CD" key is simply skipped. This prevents mis‐reading (and misalignment) of the binary data that could later lead to an invalid longitude value.

